<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Endurance — Terrain Focus</name>
  <description>WARM-UP:
- 9min building from Z1 into the Z2 target

MAIN SET:
- 22min @ 68% FTP (Z2, RPE 3)
- 22min @ 74% FTP (Z2, RPE 3)
- Position: Change hoods/drops with the terrain; stay seated over rollers
- Cadence: 80-90rpm on rises, 90-100rpm on descents

COOL-DOWN:
- 9min easy spin Z1-Z2 (RPE 3-4)</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="540" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.65" />
    <SteadyState Duration="1320" Power="0.68" />
    <SteadyState Duration="1320" Power="0.74" />
    <Cooldown Duration="540" PowerLow="0.70" PowerHigh="0.45" />
  </workout>
</workout_file>